# Modules

The ported modules, with their size in lines of Java.

| Module | Java main | Description |
|---|--:|---|
| `asm-analysis` | 2,379 | Control-flow and data-flow analysis over method bodies |
| `asm-tree` | 4,120 | The tree API: ClassNode, MethodNode, InsnList and friends |
| `asm-commons` | 1,870 | Adapters: GeneratorAdapter, LocalVariablesSorter, remappers |
| `asm-util` | 2,045 | Textifier, CheckClassAdapter and the trace visitors |
| `asm-core` | 9,812 | ClassReader, ClassWriter and the visitor interfaces |
| `asm-test` | 610 | Shared fixtures for the module test suites |
| `asm-bench` | 455 | JMH benchmarks against the previous release |
| `asm-verify` | 1,204 | Frame computation and the bytecode verifier |
| `asm-attrs` | 388 | Custom attribute prototypes and their readers |
| `asm-signature` | 702 | Generic signature parsing and writing |
| `asm-remap` | 930 | Remapping of names across a class hierarchy |
| `asm-shrink` | 1,415 | Dead-code elimination and constant folding passes |

Everything after the table.

